# WHITELIST, not a blocklist: line 1 ignores EVERYTHING in the repo, then
# every "!" line below re-includes one specific path. Nothing named below
# is excluded - the "!" is what makes it the opposite.
#
# Why: the deploy image (deploy/Dockerfile) only COPYs deploy/, servo_tester/,
# web_teleop/, and two ros_ws/src paths. Without this whitelist, `docker build`
# would still upload the whole ~2GB repo (gazebo_models_worlds_collection/
# alone is 1.3GB, .git/ is 438MB) to the daemon before filtering, every build.
*

# re-include: deploy/ (Dockerfile, entrypoint.sh, docker-compose.yml)
!deploy/
!deploy/**

# re-include: servo_tester/ (Flask app run by deploy/entrypoint.sh)
!servo_tester/
!servo_tester/**

# re-include: web_teleop/ (Flask + websocket joystick app run by entrypoint.sh)
!web_teleop/
!web_teleop/**

# re-include: the ros_ws/src packages deploy/entrypoint.sh and on-demand
# mapping/navigation roslaunch invocations need - NOT the rest of ros_ws/src
# (gazebo worlds, other robot arms, pal_gazebo_worlds etc. stay ignored)
!ros_ws/
!ros_ws/src/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/scripts/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/scripts/**
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/config/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/config/**
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/launch/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/launch/**
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/maps/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/maps/**
!ros_ws/src/nexzino_nav/package.xml
!ros_ws/src/nexzino/
!ros_ws/src/nexzino/**
!ros_ws/src/ZLAC8015D_python/
!ros_ws/src/ZLAC8015D_python/**

# re-include: only realsense2_description (pure xacro/URDF, no build needed) -
# NOT realsense2_camera from this same vendored tree, which stays apt-installed
# in deploy/Dockerfile instead (a compiled C++ node - avoids a slow catkin
# build in this image). See deploy/Dockerfile's comment for why the apt
# realsense2_description package specifically doesn't work here.
!ros_ws/src/realsense-ros-gazebo/
!ros_ws/src/realsense-ros-gazebo/realsense-ros/
!ros_ws/src/realsense-ros-gazebo/realsense-ros/realsense2_description/
!ros_ws/src/realsense-ros-gazebo/realsense-ros/realsense2_description/**

# re-excluded even though the paths above are whitelisted (order matters -
# these patterns come after the "!" lines, so they win for these matches)
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
